| Link Type | Use Case | Field |
|-----------|----------|-------|
| Parent (Next-Gen) | Story → Epic | `parent: { key: 'EPIC-KEY' }` |
| Parent (Next-Gen) | Subtask → Story | `parent: { key: 'STORY-KEY' }` |
| Blocks/Is blocked by | Dependencies | Link type |
| Relates to | Related items | Link type |

