    return <LoadingSpinner />;
}

// ✅ ALWAYS - Consistent layout
<SuspenseLoader>
    <Content />
</SuspenseLoader>
```

**Why:** Prevents Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS), better UX

**Error Handling:**
- Use `useMuiSnackbar` for user feedback
