## Advanced Patterns

### Compound Components

```typescript
// Card.tsx
export const Card: React.FC<CardProps> & {
    Header: typeof CardHeader;
    Body: typeof CardBody;
    Footer: typeof CardFooter;
} = ({ children }) => {
    return <Paper>{children}</Paper>;
};

Card.Header = CardHeader;
Card.Body = CardBody;
Card.Footer = CardFooter;

// Usage
