## Example 1: TypeScript 5.9 Type System

### Basic Type Annotations
```typescript
// Primitive types
const name: string = "John";
const age: number = 30;
const active: boolean = true;

// Union types
type Status = "pending" | "approved" | "rejected";
const status: Status = "approved";

// Intersection types
