# moai-security-identity: SAML 2.0 & OIDC Identity Management

**Enterprise SSO with SAML 2.0, OpenID Connect & OAuth 2.0**  
Trust Score: 9.9/10 | Version: 4.0.0 | Enterprise Mode | Last Updated: 2025-11-12

