## Config & Environment

Define auth-related config in a dedicated module where possible:

```ts
// src/config/auth.ts
export type AuthConfig = {
  jwtSecret: string;
  accessTokenTtlSeconds: number;
};

export function getAuthConfig(): AuthConfig {
  return {
