## Error Handling

| Code | Description |
|------|-------------|
| 200 | Success |
| 400 | Bad request (invalid JSON, missing required fields) |
| 401 | Unauthorized (invalid/missing token) |
| 403 | Forbidden (insufficient permissions) |
| 404 | Not found |
| 409 | Conflict (resource already exists) |
